 "description": "CyberPower PDU31116 monitored rack PDU, 0U, 100 to 120 V, 15 A, single phase. A black metal strip 1349 mm long, 56 mm wide and 48 mm deep for a rack's vertical channel. Twenty NEMA 5-15R outlets run along the front in two groups of ten, with a display module between them. The module holds a display, Select and Enter buttons, lamps, an Ethernet jack, three RJ45 jacks and a USB jack. A fixed 10 ft cord with a NEMA 5-15P plug leaves one end. No document shows the rear.",
 "format": 1,
 "gaps": [
  {
   "note": "no document shows the rear. The data sheet states 0 rear outlets, so none is drawn. It also states an external site ground and a cord retention tray without a position. The rear is left unshown.",
