   "note": "page 1 sees each end at a steep angle, about 34 px wide for the 48 mm depth. It shows a seam and a notch at each edge of the cap. The notches are drawn as two slots at estimated positions, read as fractions of the face. The cord leaves the cord end about 0.9 mm above its middle height, which is 1.2 px of a 71 px face. Then it curves down. How far into the 48 mm depth it leaves is not shown, so the cord is placed at mid-depth.",
   "reason": "needs-photo",
   "scope": [
