  },
  {
   "note": "no manual is held. Page 2 prints Tx/Rx and Link beside the silver Ethernet jack. It prints In / ENV beside the upper black jack and Out beside the lower one. Serial is printed beside the right-hand one and USB beside the USB jack. The black jacks are typed rj45-serial, as on the PDU41021. What each carries is not stated.",
   "reason": "vendor-silent",
